{"channelId":"UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","row":["Dogs Inc",1000000,"Our extraordinary dogs transform lives throughout the country—at no cost to recipients. What makes our pups so special? Top-notch pedigrees and countless hours of training and love. Guide dogs turn darkness into light for people with vision loss. Service dogs restore freedom for veterans. Skilled companion dogs heal the broken hearts of those struggling with loss. And they never ask for anything in return. Neither do we. We offer our clients their loyal friends, expert instruction, and lifetime support free of charge—thanks to big-hearted donors and volunteers.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:01.485Z","channelId":"UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f504f24226a38c5b08a756000eee5e474756c98b163daf8201639b148c4b4de3","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b56ab4cd994a2fbaa5f8b27a6a14a482b8f6cc3c490e70b4f7316fc62f0b3b9a"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:01.485Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1000000,"raw":"1M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZX9C1LPOpzsJfZe5BxDjw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:01.485Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://dogsinc.org/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:47:20.887Z"},{"url":"https://dogsinc.org/get-involved/veterinarian-partner/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:47:21.451Z"},{"url":"https://dogsinc.org/connect/email-us/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:47:22.045Z"},{"url":"https://dogsinc.org/about-us/strategic-alliances/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-1